Voices (assets/voice)
---------------------
  - PLACEHOLDERS: every spoken line in assets/voice/ was made with the macOS speech voices (the `say`
    command: Eddy, Rocko, Reed, Samantha and Daniel; ZK's through a voice changer made in code).
    Apple's macOS licence allows that output for personal, non-commercial use only. They must be
    replaced by recordings (actors or a voice service with a commercial licence) before the game
    is published. assets/voice/manifest.json records each line's source; docs/VOICE-LINES.md is the
    line sheet and says how to drop the recordings in.
